WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t2-06-double-standard.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:05.790
You are sitting with a clear observation of an unfair double standard.

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:12.180
A rule that is applied strictly to you while another person walks free of it,
or vice versa.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.690
The injustice is real, you have documented the instances.

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:30.700
And your assessment is accurate.

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:36.330
However, being right and being at peace are two entirely different
experiences.

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:38.350
And this session serves your peace.

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:59.600
The body registers the unfairness immediately as a somatic threat.

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:03.460
While the mind begins constructing an unassailable legal case.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:07.510
Leaving your nervous system tripped in the conflict between the two.

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:11.020
Let us move through four steps to free your energy.

phase-recognise
00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:15.800
First, we recognise where this indignity settles physically in your frame.

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:19.580
It often manifests as a tight knot in the centre of the chest.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:23.530
A sharp constriction in the throat where unspoken words are held.

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:26.520
Or a rigid tension across the back of the neck.

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.680
Give this physical holding one precise word.

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:43.680
Such as

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.560
Restricted or braced

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:49.900
Observe the profound relief in what that one word leaves out.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:56.130
It seats aside the long list of evidence, the chronological history, and the
endless inner arguments.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.760
Your factual evidence remains intact.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:13.710
But we are pausing the exhausting courtroom trial inside your head.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:33.850
Drop one layer deeper to sense what this structural inequality suggests about
your value.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.830
Or standing in the relationship.

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:53.300
And let that uncomfortable reality be seen without trying to fix it
immediately.

phase-regulate
00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:58.060
We regulate your system to dissolve the physical tension.

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:18.470
And hail for a steady 6 seconds, expanding your rib cage fully.

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:21.320
And exhale for a steady six seconds.

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:40.260
Bring your warm, grounded focus directly into the space behind your sternum.

00:03:57.220 --> 00:04:01.800
Allow your mental chatter to come and go without enrolling in another internal
trial.

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:17.780
If you feel yourself straining to achieve perfect calm, drop the effort.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:22.540
Pushing against yourself only reinforces the rigid structure you are trying to
soften.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.960
Stay in this present awareness longer than you normally would.

phase-release
00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:41.830
Third, we release the compulsion to build a trial case.

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:57.170
Differentiate clearly between the two dynamics.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:15.500
There is the actual imbalance in the role which you perceived correctly.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:19.680
And there is the endless collecting of evidence to build an unanswerable case.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:37.680
You see, winning the case in your head does not resolve the relationship.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:43.060
It only builds a reservoir of unexpressed resentment that burns your own
system.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.610
Let's keep your clear vision of the facts.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:05.100
But lay down the heavy labor of collecting and rehearsing them.

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:08.750
Ask your inner self with gentle curiosity.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:12.600
What was this hypervigilance originally designed to protect?

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:33.010
A heightened sensitivity to fairness usually develops in environments.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:37.560
We're keeping track of rules was necessary for emotional or physical safety.

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:59.790
Honor that protective mechanism, recognizing that it was created by an earlier
version of you.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.190
Doing their best to maintain control.

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:07.240
Breathe into any underlying fear of being taken advantage of.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.130
Powerless or silence

phase-rise
00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:26.170
We rise into dignified personal authority.

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:44.370
See yourself sitting across the room, holding a clear, valid observation.

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:47.170
Without needing to burn your energy to justify it.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:05.160
Now, visualize the mature, grounded version of yourself facing this double
standard.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:29.120
A version who drops the long list of historic examples and speaks one calm,
simple, direct sentence.

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:33.350
Outlining what you will or will not accept moving forward.

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:38.200
Step fully into that quiet, dignified strength right now.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.940
Feel the clarity of a boundary that requires no argument.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:47.760
Select the single clean move or statement you will make when this dynamic next
appears.

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:03.950
Take one final full breath in for six.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:06.440
And let it out smoothly for six.

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:09.120
Feel the grounding weight of your body.

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:11.410
Gently stretch your fingers and toes.

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:12.670
Open your eyes

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:14.630
And return to this meditation.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:19.170
Whenever you need to replace endless argument with quiet personal power.
